<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#e9e7e1"/><meta name="description" content="Jeevandas — independent AI systems and web engineering."/><title>Jeevandas® — Digital systems, made useful.</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin/><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<style>
